          "settings": {
            "title": "Returns",
            "answer": "<p>We offer a 30-Day Money Back Guarantee on undamaged products. Customers are responsible for any shipping costs involved in the return process, which will include a 15% restocking fee. Items must be returned within 14 days of starting your return process.<br/><br/>Please complete the form below, and send all items to the following address:</p><p>The Net Return, LLC.<br/>280 9th Ave.<br/>Unit #4<br/>Hawthorne, NJ 07506</p><p>(973) 636-7354</p><p><a href=\"https://paulthenet.returnscenter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://paulthenet.returnscenter.com/\">Start Your Return</a></p>"
          }
